/-!
# `F₄` presentation: propagation steps (definitions)

The 324 relations are a BFS from `P₀` under the lowering generators `F = [26, 13, 46, 47]`,
unnormalized: every `P_k` (`k ≥ 1`) is `ad(g) P_j` exactly for its BFS parent `j < k`. The steps
`(g, j, k)` were recovered by a script not included in this release; `stepOK` checks
`ad(g) P_j - P_k = 0` as a sparse quadratic. The checks are split over `F4LieStepsA..D`.
-/

set_option maxRecDepth 100000

